      "section": "Background and presenting situation"
    },
    {
      "text": "Margaret Doyle lives in a home with a high step that she warns visitors about.",
      "cites": [2],
      "section": "Background and presenting situation"
    },
    {
      "text": "Margaret Doyle has a cat named Biscuit who is 11 years old.",
      "cites": [9],
      "section": "Background and presenting situation"
    },
    {
      "text": "Margaret Doyle said she does not trust herself to carry two cups and a frame.",
      "cites": [17],
      "section": "Needs and daily living"
    },
    {
      "text": "Margaret Doyle was referred to social care by the hospital after discharge.",
      "cites": [23],
      "section": "Background and presenting situation"
    },
    {
      "text": "The purpose of the visit is a needs assessment under the Care Act.",
      "cites": [24],
      "section": "Background and presenting situation"
    },
    {
      "text": "The needs assessment aims to understand how Margaret is managing daily life, what is difficult, what is working, and what matters to her.",
      "cites": [26],
      "section": "Background and presenting situation"
    },
    {
      "text": "Margaret Doyle does not want to be placed in a care home or institution.",
      "cites": [29],
      "section": "Background and presenting situation"
    },
    {
      "text": "The needs assessment is not about placing Margaret in a care home or institution.",
      "cites": [30],
      "section": "Background and presenting situation"
    },
    {
      "text": "The needs assessment is about supporting Margaret in her current home environment.",
      "cites": [31],
      "section": "Background and presenting situation"
    },
    {
      "text": "Margaret Doyle has a quiz programme she watches at 4:00 p.m.",
      "cites": [34],
      "section": "Background and presenting situation"
    },
    {
      "text": "Margaret Doyle said she never gets the answers to the quiz and shouts at the television.",
      "cites": [36],
      "section": "Background and presenting situation"
    },
    {
      "text": "Margaret Doyle said she would allow the social worker to take notes during the assessment.",
      "cites": [37],
      "section": "Background and presenting situation"
    },
    {
      "text": "Margaret Doyle said her handwriting has deteriorated since the last time she wrote anything.",
      "cites": [38],
      "section": "Background and presenting situation"
    },
    {
      "text": "Margaret Doyle said she is comfortable with the social worker sharing information with her GP and any other involved support services.",
      "cites": [43],
      "section": "Background and presenting situation"
    },
    {
      "text": "Margaret Doyle said she has nothing to hide, but added 'mostly'.",
      "cites": [45],
      "section": "Background and presenting situation"
    },
    {
      "text": "Kevin Doyle is Margaret's son.",
      "cites": [46],
      "section": "Background and presenting situation"
    },
    {
      "text": "Kevin Doyle said he would try to come over after finishing an early shift.",
      "cites": [47],
      "section": "Background and presenting situation"
    },
    {
      "text": "Kevin Doyle said he might arrive around half past eleven.",
      "cites": [48],
      "section": "Background and presenting situation"
    },
    {
      "text": "Kevin Doyle said he will 'put his tuppence in' when he visits.",
      "cites": [50],
      "section": "Background and presenting situation"
    },
    {
      "text": "Margaret Doyle fell on the third of March, a Monday.",
      "cites": [52],
      "section": "Needs and daily living"
    },
    {
      "text": "Margaret Doyle was in the kitchen when she fell.",
      "cites": [54],
      "section": "Needs and daily living"
    },
    {
      "text": "Margaret Doyle does not know if she tripped or if she went dizzy.",
      "cites": [55],
      "section": "Needs and daily living"
    },
    {
      "text": "Margaret Doyle fell from the sink to the floor by the back door.",
      "cites": [56],
      "section": "Needs and daily living"
    },
    {
      "text": "Margaret Doyle was on the floor for about two hours.",
      "cites": [61],
      "section": "Needs and daily living"
    },
    {
      "text": "Margaret Doyle could not get up after the fall.",
      "cites": [58],
      "section": "Needs and daily living"
    },
    {
      "text": "Margaret Doyle tried to turn over but could not put any weight on her wrist.",
      "cites": [59],
      "section": "Needs and daily living"
    }
  ]
}

{
  "facts": [
    {
      "text": "Margaret Doyle can walk about ten minutes to the shops before the fall.",
      "cites": [
        106
      ],
