      "text": "Margaret Doyle walked to the shops slowly, with a sense of control, and said she would do it.",
      "cites": [
        107
      ],
      "section": "Needs and daily living"
    },
    {
      "text": "Margaret Doyle is frightened of going over again after the fall.",
      "cites": [
        110
      ],
      "section": "Needs and daily living"
    },
    {
      "text": "Margaret Doyle had a fall in the garden before Christmas, where she sat down on the grass.",
      "cites": [
        114
      ],
      "section": "Needs and daily living"
    },
    {
      "text": "Margaret Doyle had a fall in the bathroom in January, where she caught herself on the sink.",
      "cites": [
        115
      ],
      "section": "Needs and daily living"
