    },
    {
      "text": "Margaret Doyle's GP is Dr Shah at Millbrook Surgery on Church Lane.",
      "cites": [
        122
      ],
      "section": "Background and presenting situation"
    },
    {
      "text": "Margaret Doyle previously saw Dr Patel at Millbrook Surgery, who retired last summer.",
      "cites": [
        126
      ],
      "section": "Background and presenting situation"
    },
    {
      "text": "Margaret Doyle has not been referred to a falls clinic or had a falls assessment by her GP.",
